commit_message:
ENH Add `"cube_root"` option to `n_bins` parameter in `calibration_curve` and `CalibrationDisplay` (#33856)

@ZeyuSun Thanks for this contribution
@ogrisel @atoinebaker Thanks for reviews and discussions

DOC fix intercept_ and coef_ docs for LogisticRegression(CV) (#7420)

* coef_ can be of shape (1, n_features) for binary problems;
* intercept can be of shape (1,) for binary problems;
* intercept_ is set to zero, not unavailable when fit_intercept is False;
* raw_coef_ is removed (see GH-3416)

MAINT big refactor of sklearn.cluster.bicluster

* Removed dead and useless code in the utils submodule;
* decoupled sklearn.base from the bicluster module (no more deep import);
* rewrote tests to test the API, not the implementation;
* added input validation to the get_submatrix method (but it still needs
  documentation, because I've no idea what to pass for data);
* got rid of the subdirectory when it turned out only one file was left.

DOC remove import scikits.learn from tutorial

I think this is mostly a distraction here;
probably better for readers to take it out.

Revert "ENH sparsify and densify methods for CD models"

This reverts commit ee85da8421a35894620e86dbd5b0013b5628812f;
shouldn't have been committed to master.

MAINT refactor fast_dot

* check for NumPy >= 1.7.2 at import time, instead of in every call;
* save a function call when newer NumPy is available;
* rewrote documentation;
* put the docstring on fast_dot instead of _fast_dot;
* remove spurious warnings for matrix-vector multiplications (some of these
  are suboptimal with older np.dot, but the good ones were triggering a
  warning as well).

changes to newsgroups example:
- only print the best biclusters, ranked by ncut;
- increase example batch size

BUG: replace elif by if in Ridge solver selection.

@fabianp: Since you know that better than me, can you add a
regression test that triggers the LinAlgError. Thanks!

ENH Create FeatureSelectionMixin for shared [inverse_]transform code

Also rename FeatureSelectionMixin -> SelectorMixin -> _LearntSelectorMixin
And rename sklearn.feature_selection.{selector_mixin -> from_model}

use random_sample_mask (issue pointed out by @glouppe);
rename train_deviance and oob_deviance to train_score_ and oob_score_;
doc attributes

TEST: Fix cross_validation tests

@schwarty: please also run the doctests.

assert_less_equal is not in nose v 0.11.1
